<main class="content narrow prose">
  <h1>Credits</h1>
  <p class="lead">Lekmod Scion and Lekmap Scion are maintained by <a href="https://github.com/brunotho">brunotho</a>. They stand on the work of many others.</p>

  <h2>Lekmod and Lekmap</h2>
  <p>Lekmod Scion continues <a href="https://github.com/EnormousApplePie/Lekmod">Lekmod</a> (from LEKMOD v35.4), the community balance and content mod by EnormousApplePie and the Lekmod contributors, which itself brings together the work of many Civilization V modders. Lekmap Scion continues Lekmap 6.0.6, Lekmod's map script.</p>

  <h2>3D models</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Self-Propelled Artillery</strong>: <a href="https://skfb.ly/6TKwT">"Ha-to artillery"</a> by Herdyn, licensed under <a href="http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">Creative Commons Attribution 4.0</a>. Changed for the game: fewer polygons, the textures combined into one, the number markings removed, and set on the Modern Armor's skeleton and animations.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Tools</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="https://github.com/deliverator23/Nexus-Buddy-2_Release">Nexus Buddy 2</a> and the <a href="https://github.com/deliverator23/Civilization-Blender-Scripts">Civilization Blender scripts</a> by Deliverator, used to bring 3D models into the game.</li>
    <li><a href="https://www.blender.org/">Blender</a>.</li>
  </ul>
</main>
